        tryIt: "In the Consumer Fault Recovery: Message Claiming with XCLAIM & Dead Consumer Eviction code editor, adjust claimStaleStreamMessage (currently 1) and pelMap to test boundary conditions, then run the snippet and verify how the computed output responds.",
