        tryIt: "In the PostgreSQL Concurrency Cost: Process-Per-Connection Architecture & RAM Sizing code editor, adjust calculatePostgresMemoryFootprint (currently 12) and activeConnections to test boundary conditions, then run the snippet and verify how the computed output responds.",
